WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:08.500
In Game of Thrones, the great houses of Westeros
are the Starks, Greyjoys, Tullys, Arryns,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.269
Lannisters, Tyrells, Baratheons, and Martells.

00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:15.969
All these families are important to the story,
but some of these plotlines are totally different

00:00:15.969 --> 00:00:21.720
in the books compared to the TV show, especially
the Martells of Dorne.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:29.109
Dorne is a land of scorching deserts and red
mountains, of scorpions, snakes, and oases.

00:00:29.109 --> 00:00:33.570
Dorne has its own distinct culture, cause
a thousand years ago, a foreign princess called

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.960
Nymeria led her people to migrate to Dorne.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.590
So Dorne has more equality for women – Dornish
women have equal rights to inherit and rule

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:44.100
as a man does.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:49.900
And Dorne is more relaxed about sex – paramours
and bastards and homosexuality are more accepted

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.350
in Dorne.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:57.370
Three hundred years ago, when Aegon Targaryen
conquered Westeros, Dorne was the only kingdom

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:02.020
to resist him, using guerrilla tactics to
escape his dragons.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:06.469
Dorne only joined the other kingdoms much
later – and not by conquest, but by marriage

00:01:06.469 --> 00:01:08.909
between the Martells and Targaryens.

00:01:08.909 --> 00:01:17.069
So Dorne has a proud history of independence
and defiance – the Martell words are “Unbowed,

00:01:17.069 --> 00:01:19.079
Unbent, Unbroken”.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:24.200
Eighteen years ago, the King of Westeros was
Aerys Targaryen, and the heir to the throne

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.840
was Prince Rhaegar, the older brother of Viserys
and Daenerys.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:35.219
Rhaegar married Elia Martell, the beloved
sister of Doran and Oberyn Martell.

00:01:35.219 --> 00:01:37.789
And their uncle Lewyn was in the Kingsguard.

00:01:37.789 --> 00:01:43.369
So the Martells were closely tied to the Targaryen
throne, giving them lots of political influence

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.490
and prestige.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:49.970
Rhaegar and Elia had two kids – future rulers
of Westeros.

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:55.779
But unfortunately, King Aerys was a mad cruel
tyrant, and Prince Rhaegar ran off with Lyanna

00:01:55.779 --> 00:02:02.030
Stark to have a prophecy baby, so Robert Baratheon
fought a war to make himself King.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.289
Rhaegar and Lewyn were killed in battle.

00:02:05.289 --> 00:02:10.350
Tywin Lannister attacked King’s Landing,
and his soldier, the Mountain, Gregor Clegane

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:15.670
[and Amory Lorch], raped and killed Princess
Elia and her two children.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:20.840
Elia was meant to become Rhaegar’s queen,
her children were gonna rule Westeros.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:27.480
But all that was lost, and King Robert married
Cersei, so a Lannister became the queen instead

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.480
of Elia.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:34.220
So Elia’s brothers Doran and Oberyn were
furious and aggrieved.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:39.680
They lost their beloved sister, and her children,
and their uncle Lewyn, and lost their political

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.280
prospects with the Targaryens.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:47.020
Ever since, they’ve wanted revenge against
the Lannisters, and to get a Targaryen back

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.340
in power – they want “Vengeance.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.340
Justice.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.660
Fire and blood.”

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.460
But they don’t get it right away.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.220
The Prince of Dorne is Doran Martell.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:04.210
He’s a “cautious”, “patient”, ruler,
who thinks carefully before taking action.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.420
Doran is full of pain and grief.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:12.960
He suffers from gout, a disease that causes
swollen painful joints – “and he still

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.610
mourns his sister Elia”.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:20.520
So Doran sits in a wheelchair in a palace
called the Water Gardens, watching children

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.520
play.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:25.960
The kids remind him of his responsibility
to protect the people of Dorne.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:31.100
He wants revenge against the Lannisters, but
he also wants to protect innocent lives.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:37.270
So Doran won’t start a war that he might
lose – Doran plays the game of thrones to

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.680
win.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:41.410
Oberyn is the opposite to Doran.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:45.910
Known as the Red Viper, he’s “dangerous”
and “unpredictable”.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.690
Provocative and passionate, a warrior and
a womaniser.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:55.610
When he was sixteen, Oberyn had sex with Lord
Yronwood’s paramour, and they fought a duel

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.920
over her.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:01.880
Oberyn used a poisoned weapon, so Yronwood
was killed, which was a problem cause the

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.250
Yronwoods are the second most powerful house
in Dorne.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:09.400
To prevent conflict, Doran gave his son Quentyn
to be fostered with the Yronwoods.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:15.600
And Oberyn went overseas for a while – fighting
as a mercenary, studying as a maester, and

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.880
fathering bastards all over the world.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:25.040
So Doran and Oberyn are very different, but
Doran says they work together closely.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:32.590
He says if Oberyn is a viper, Doran is the
grass, hiding the viper before it strikes.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:37.590
In Book 2, Westeros is at war, and King Joffrey
needs allies.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:43.470
So Tyrion Lannister offers an alliance with
Dorne, and Doran accepts.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:49.020
Princess Myrcella goes to Dorne and is betrothed
to marry Trystane, Doran’s younger son.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:54.250
Myrcella and Trystane are young kids in the
books, and they develop an adorable innocent

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:59.800
friendship – but soon, their families’
feuds threaten their peaceful lives [like

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.800
Montague and Capulets].

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.660
Tyrion invites Doran to come to King’s Landing
and join the small council.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:09.970
But instead of cautious patient Doran, the
Red Viper arrives.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:15.139
Oberyn demands “justice” for the death
of Elia, and wants vengeance against Gregor

00:05:15.139 --> 00:05:16.400
and Tywin.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:20.500
So in Tyrion’s trial by combat, Oberyn fights
the Mountain.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:25.400
He wounds Gregor with a poisoned spear, but
Gregor kills Oberyn.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:29.630
It’s not clear what Doran and Oberyn’s
plan was here – [Doran says conflicting

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.970
things] – but this attempt at justice just
makes things worse.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:37.820
Oberyn’s death inflames the Dornish people
into uproar.

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:43.570
They want war against the Lannisters to avenge
Oberyn and Elia, and leading the call are

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.370
Oberyn’s daughters, the Sand Snakes.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:49.580
Oberyn had eight bastard daughters, by five
different mothers.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:55.290
They all have different personalities and
skills – but they all have Oberyn’s “viper

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.290
eyes”.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:06:01.450
The eldest, Obara, is a warrior – strong
and fierce and angry.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:06.930
Nymeria is beautiful and ladylike, but deadly
with hidden blades.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:12.440
Tyene seems innocent and sweet, but she’s
an expert with poisons.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:17.020
After Oberyn’s death, the Snakes come to
Doran and demand war.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.810
So Doran imprisons the Sand Snakes, to keep
the peace.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.380
It seems like Doran is playing nice with the
Lannisters.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:28.730
People think he’s just too weak and “afraid”
to avenge his siblings.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:32.740
So Doran’s daughter takes action.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:37.960
Arianne Martell is Prince Doran’s heir – meaning
she’ll rule Dorne after he dies.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:43.150
But Arianne feels that Doran doesn’t trust
or respect or love her.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:48.030
He never shares his plans with her, and never
teaches her to rule, and never arranged a

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.090
good marriage for her.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:56.590
Arianne believes that Doran wants to make
his son Quentyn his heir instead of her – and

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:00.410
Arianne refuses to be cheated of her of birthright.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:06.591
So Arianne starts a secret plot – she plans
to crown Myrcella as Queen of Westeros, a

00:07:06.591 --> 00:07:11.699
rival to King Tommen, to provoke war between
Dorne and the Lannisters.

00:07:11.699 --> 00:07:17.180
This war would give the Martells their vengeance,
and would position Arianne to rule Dorne,

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.650
instead of Quentyn and Doran.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:23.860
So Arianne seduces Myrcella’s guard, Ser
Arys, and she and her friends take Myrcella,

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:28.160
but she’s caught by Doran’s guard Areo
Hotah.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:33.530
Ser Arys is killed, and this emo asshole Darkstar
attacks Myrcella.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:39.120
Darkstar cuts off part of Myrcella’s face,
before fleeing into the desert.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.630
So Arianne’s plot goes terribly wrong.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.340
And it turns out the whole thing was based
on a “misunderstanding”.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:55.130
Doran doesn’t hate Arianne, or want Quentyn
to rule Dorne – Doran has plans for Arianne.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:08:00.860
It turns out that all this time that Doran
avoided war, and made peace with the Lannisters,

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:06.240
he was secretly planning revenge – he’s
“worked at the downfall of Tywin Lannister

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.699
since the day they told [him] of Elia”.

00:08:09.699 --> 00:08:14.490
Doran reveals that after Robert took over
Westeros, the Martells made a secret pact

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:19.900
with the Targaryens to marry Arianne to Viserys
Targaryen.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:24.930
The plan was that the Martells would help
Viserys take back the Throne, and destroy

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:29.940
the Lannisters – for “Vengeance”, “Justice”,
“Fire and blood”.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:35.640
But since Doran was so cautious and patient,
he didn’t want to risk war until Viserys

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.690
was ready, and had an army.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:44.730
So for like ten years Doran didn’t tell
Arianne or Viserys about the marriage pact.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:49.850
And Doran didn’t help Viserys and Daenerys
while they grew up on the streets of Essos.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:53.980
Viserys died never knowing about the pact.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:59.529
And Doran’s secrecy just alienated his own
daughter to the point where she plotted against

00:08:59.529 --> 00:09:00.529
him.

00:09:00.529 --> 00:09:02.910
So Doran’s plan failed.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:08.740
But now that the Viserys is dead, Doran has
a new plan – instead of Arianne marrying

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:12.950
Viserys, he’ll have his son Quentyn marry
Daenerys.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.010
That way Dorne can help Daenerys take the
Throne, and get vengeance on the Lannisters,

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:23.320
and Quentyn and Daenerys can be King and Queen
of Westeros, while Arianne can rule Dorne.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:30.250
It’s a nice plan – but like the previous
plan, it’s a fucken disaster.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:37.240
Quentyn Martell goes on a long and dangerous
journey to Meereen, to marry Daenerys Targaryen.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:42.061
He tells himself it’s a “grand adventure”,
like the heroes in the stories – a young

00:09:42.061 --> 00:09:47.470
prince and his friends travel to distant lands,
to marry “The most beautiful woman in the

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:48.580
world”.

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:52.340
But Quentyn learns that adventure stinks.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.040
His best friend gets killed by pirates.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:00.170
He’s forced to join with mercenaries, and
to fight in war-torn Astapor.

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:06.089
The whole journey is traumatic and horrible,
and when Quentyn finally meets Daenerys, and

00:10:06.089 --> 00:10:08.360
offers to marry her, she laughs.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:14.220
Cause Quentyn’s nickname is Frog, and Daenerys
knows fairy tales about frogs who turn into

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.880
enchanted princes for their true love.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:22.430
But sadly, Quentyn is “Neither enchanted
nor enchanting”.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.740
Quentyn isn’t a handsome Prince Charming.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:29.850
He’s short and awkward [and thicc] and kinda
fugly.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:35.690
His personality is like his father’s – he’s
“sensible”, “dutiful”, and “dull”,

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:40.600
while Daenerys is attracted to hot bad boys
with blue beards like Daario.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:46.110
Quentyn says Dorne will help Daenerys take
Westeros, but Dorne is no help to Daenerys

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:49.190
now – she’s busy trying to bring peace
to Meereen.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:54.640
So Daenerys marries Hizdahr instead, and then
she fucks off on a dragon and disappears,

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:57.540
leaving Quentyn feeling like an idiot.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.890
He crossed half the world to marry Daenerys.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:06.200
If he goes home without her, he’ll disappoint
his father and fail his country.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:11.080
So Quentyn decides to be brave and bold like
the heroes in the stories.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:17.779
He plans to steal one of Daenerys’ dragons,
and fly it to find Daenerys, and win her heart,

00:11:17.779 --> 00:11:21.790
and take her back to Dorne for fire and blood.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:28.700
But it turns out -- being a brave young prince
is not enough to tame a ten-tonne fire-breathing

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.899
lizard – and Dany’s dragons burn Quentyn
alive.

00:11:32.899 --> 00:11:37.200
Quentyn’s last word is “Oh”.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:40.529
So life is not like a fairy tale.

00:11:40.529 --> 00:11:46.960
And another Martell plan for fire and blood
ends in disaster.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:51.170
Back in Dorne, Doran doesn’t know his son
is dead.

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:57.080
He’s still waiting for Quentyn to come home,
with Daenerys.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:03.120
A Targaryen does land in Westeros – but
not the Targaryen he was expecting.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:06.400
In the books, there’s this kid called Young
Griff.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:12.810
Varys and Illyrio claim that Young Griff is
Aegon Targaryen, the son of Rhaegar Targaryen,

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.190
and Elia Martell.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:18.110
Everyone thinks that Aegon died in Robert’s
Rebellion.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:22.959
But Varys claims that they secretly swapped
out the baby, so some other baby died, and

00:12:22.959 --> 00:12:28.600
the real Aegon survived – and Varys and
Illyrio have a conspiracy to make this Aegon

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.670
King of Westeros.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:35.899
There are hints that this Aegon is fake, and
he’s not really Elia’s son – go watch

00:12:35.899 --> 00:12:37.510
the Varys video.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:43.910
But real or fake, Aegon could take the Iron
Throne – his army has taken some castles,

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.960
and Tommen’s throne under Cersei is weak.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:50.190
So Aegon asks Doran for an alliance.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:56.130
Doran hopes that this kid really is his long
lost nephew, Elia’s son.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:02.130
But Doran is cautious, and wants to make sure
that Aegon’s legit, so Doran sends Arianne

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.829
to check him out.

00:13:03.829 --> 00:13:08.870
After her plot with Myrcella, Arianne seems
to have changed, to have become loyal and

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.660
obedient to Doran.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:16.380
He tells her to just meet with Aegon, and
report back, to be patient and careful.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:20.260
But Arianne still has ambitions.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:25.440
Arianne feels jealous that if Quentyn marries
Daenerys and they take the Throne, Quentyn

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:31.440
will be king of Westeros, while Arianne will
only rule Dorne – will she have to kneel

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:34.330
to “King Quentyn”?.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:39.480
This sibling rivalry might lead Arianne to
take bold action.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:44.079
Fans speculate that Arianne might yolo it
and suddenly marry Aegon.

00:13:44.079 --> 00:13:50.220
Cause if Aegon becomes King, his wife Arianne
would be Queen of Westeros – so she wouldn’t

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.760
have to kneel to anyone.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:57.350
But like every other Martell plan, this might
end badly.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:03.390
It is very possible that Aegon and Arianne
will take the Throne in King’s Landing.

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:09.019
But eventually, Daenerys and her dragons will
arrive – and she won’t be happy to find

00:14:09.019 --> 00:14:12.510
a fake Targaryen sitting on her Throne.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:17.860
Author George Martin has hinted that there’ll
be a second Dance of the Dragons, a civil

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:23.480
war between Targaryens – meaning that Aegon
and Daenerys might fight.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:29.360
One character has a dream that dragons are
coming, and everywhere the dragons dance,

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.529
the people die.

00:14:31.529 --> 00:14:37.620
So the ending of the books will be different
to the TV show, but it seems likely that Daenerys

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:43.660
and Aegon’s conflict, along with Cersei
and Aerys’ wildfire, will cause King’s

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.269
Landing to burn.

00:14:45.269 --> 00:14:49.579
And if Arianne is with Aegon, she’ll burn
too.

00:14:49.579 --> 00:14:56.089
Like Oberyn and like Quentyn, Arianne’s
desire for fire and blood, may end in fire

00:14:56.089 --> 00:14:58.370
and blood.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.110
The Sand Snakes might also be doomed.

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:05.320
Obara Nymeria and Tyene swear obedience to
Doran.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:11.290
Doran sends Obara with Areo and Ser Balon,
to go kill Darkstar, the edgelord who attacked

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:12.290
Myrcella.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.450
It’s 3 v 1.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:19.660
But Darkstar is “dangerous” – and he
might steal Dawn, a legendary magic sword.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:23.660
We’re warned that Darkstar might kill Obara.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:27.020
If Obara survives Darkstar, she might go to
nearby Oldtown.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:32.040
Cause Obara’s mother was from Oldtown, and
she seems to have some major mommy issues,

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:36.430
cause she now “hates” Oldtown – says
she wants to attack, and burn the city.

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.790
[Raiding Oldtown is a time-honoured tradition
for the Dornish].

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:42.430
And interestingly, Obara’s sister Sarella
is at Oldtown, studying as a maester at the

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:44.490
Citadel, in disguise.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:48.389
Sarella loves Oldtown as much as Obara hates
it.

00:15:48.389 --> 00:15:53.550
So it could be dramatic if Obara attacks the
city – at the same time that Euron and his

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.430
apocalyptic magic are approaching.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:02.360
Fundamentally, Obara is motivated by anger
– she’s “chasing after something she

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.500
can never catch”.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:11.110
Maybe at Oldtown, or with Darkstar, Obara
will be killed, tragically consumed by her

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.490
fury.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:17.000
Meanwhile, Tyene and Nymeria are going to
King’s Landing.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:22.870
Doran wants Tyene to infiltrate the High Sparrow’s
sept, and for Nymeria to join Queen Cersei’s

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:23.870
council.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:27.670
Cersei is about to go on trial for adultery
and treason.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:34.529
And her champion is Robert Strong, the reanimated
corpse of the Mountain, Gregor Clegane, who

00:16:34.529 --> 00:16:36.750
killed Elia and Oberyn.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.480
The Lannisters say Gregor is dead.

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:45.060
They even send Gregor’s skull to Dorne,
which raises the question, how does Gregor

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:47.940
have a head without his skull?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.399
Was someone else’s giant skull sent to Dorne?

00:16:51.399 --> 00:16:57.410
Or does Gregor now have someone else’s head,
or some gnarly necromantic clusterfuck under

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:04.400
his helmet Bran has a dream of “darkness
and thick black blood” beneath a giant’s

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.400
helm.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.640
Maybe that’ll be dramatically revealed during
Cersei’s trial by combat.

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:14.089
Cause Nymeria says that if Gregor appears
again, Cersei “will be exposed as a liar

00:17:14.089 --> 00:17:16.540
before all the Seven Kingdoms”.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:21.449
Nymeria and Tyene will be furious that the
man who murdered their father still fights

00:17:21.449 --> 00:17:23.220
for the Lannisters.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.880
Maybe they’ll take revenge.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.630
Nymeria says that she wants to murder Tommen.

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:33.549
And there is that whole prophecy that Cersei’s
children will die.

00:17:33.549 --> 00:17:38.750
And Nymeria will be perfectly placed on the
queen’s council, with her hidden blades,

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.630
and with Tyene’s poison.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:46.910
So maybe the Sand Snakes will kill Tommen,
and maybe Myrcella as well, in a horrific

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.890
bloody act of vengeance.

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:54.809
Maybe the deaths of her children will lead
Cersei to burn King’s Landing, or maybe

00:17:54.809 --> 00:18:00.580
it’ll be Dany’s dragonfire – but either
way, in the flames, Nymeria and Tyene’s

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:08.610
obsession with vengeance may end with their
deaths by fire and blood – just like Oberyn

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:12.120
Quentyn Arianne and Obara before them.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:19.890
All of Doran’s plans for vengeance justice
fire and blood go terribly wrong.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:26.780
Partly because he’s too cautious, and untrusting
– Barristan says Doran “keeps his secrets”

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:27.900
“Too well”.

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.140
And Doran waits too long.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:35.180
Doran’s first line describes the orange
trees in his Water Garden – “The blood

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:41.480
oranges are well past ripe” – he waits
too long, so they fall and splat upon the

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.480
ground.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:47.370
If Doran had attacked the Lannisters earlier,
while Tywin and Gregor were still alive, then

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:51.160
maybe the Martells could’ve got justice
for Elia’s murder.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:55.910
But now that Tywin and Gregor are dead, they
can only get vengeance on Tywin’s family,

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.620
who had nothing to do with Elia’s murder.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:04.549
So at this point, a war for vengeance will
only cause more death and suffering.

00:19:04.549 --> 00:19:10.910
Oberyn’s paramour Ellaria says vengeance
is an endless terrible cycle of violence.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.140
Oberyn died avenging Elia.

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.730
Now the Sand Snakes want to avenge him.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:19.520
If they die, will their younger sisters have
to die for them?

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:22.230
There’s no meaning in death.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:27.630
Having Gregor’s skull doesn’t make Ellaria
happy – a skull can’t warm her bed or

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.309
make her smile.

00:19:29.309 --> 00:19:34.350
As Quentyn’s friend tells him right before
he gets himself burned, “Men’s lives have

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:37.410
meaning, not their deaths”.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:42.990
Justice can have meaning, but Obara Nymeria
and Tyene’s obsession with vengeance, by

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:47.940
murdering children, and starting wars, can
only end badly.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:53.220
And Arianne puts her country at risk for the
sake of her pride and ambition.

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:57.929
Ellaria says that “Doom and death are coming”
to Dorne.

00:19:57.929 --> 00:20:03.330
You can imagine Doran sitting in the Water
Gardens, when Quentyn’s bones come home.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:09.830
And he’ll realise that all his careful plots
and plans have only got his family killed.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:17.010
Tragically, the Martells’ might for justice
and vengeance just causes more injustice and

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.180
death.

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:22.799
Sometimes fire and blood only makes ash.

